":"https://api.github.com/users/yvlad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvlad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvlad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvlad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvlad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvlad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvlad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvlad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yvlad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-09-15T07:47:00Z","updated_at":"2017-09-15T07:47:00Z","body":"Using BouncyCastle provider for ```AES/CBC/PKCS5PADDING``` cipher totally fixed issue.\r\nI am using this code snippet to create ```Cipher``` in ```CachedContentIndex ``` now:\r\n```java\r\n  @NonNull\r\n  private Cipher createCipher() throws NoSuchPaddingException, NoSuchAlgorithmException {\r\n    if (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT == Build.VERSION_CODES.JELLY_BEAN_MR2) {\r\n      // https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/36976726\r\n      // https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2755\r\n      try {\r\n        return Cipher.getInstance(\"AES/CBC/PKCS5PADDING\", \"BC\");\r\n      } catch (final NoSuchProviderException ignored) {\r\n        // ignored\r\n      } catch (final NoSuchPaddingException ignored) {\r\n        // ignored\r\n      } catch (final NoSuchAlgorithmException ignored) {\r\n        // ignored\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n    return Cipher.getInstance(\"AES/CBC/PKCS5PADDING\");\r\n  }\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/329708192/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"yvlad","id":27954603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3OTU0NjAz","av